sequenceDiagram
autonumber

actor FE as Frontend / Postman
participant GW as Gateway :8099
participant SET as Setting Service :8092
participant IAUTH as Auth Internal API :8091
participant SDB as Setting DB
participant ADB as Auth DB

rect rgb(245,245,245)
Note over FE,ADB: URMM (Role Module)
FE->>GW: POST /api/v1/setting/role-modules/reference-data
GW->>SET: Forward
SET->>SDB: Load active roles/modules + privileges
SET-->>GW: reference-data
GW-->>FE: Response

FE->>GW: POST /api/v1/setting/role-modules/view {roleCode}
GW->>SET: Forward
SET->>IAUTH: /internal/role-modules/{roleCode}/get
IAUTH->>ADB: Read role_module_access (company)
IAUTH-->>SET: canView list
SET-->>GW: view response
GW-->>FE: Response

FE->>GW: POST /api/v1/setting/role-modules/update-by-id
GW->>SET: Forward
SET->>IAUTH: /internal/role-modules/update
IAUTH->>ADB: Upsert role_module_access
IAUTH-->>SET: success
SET-->>GW: success
GW-->>FE: Response
end

rect rgb(245,245,245)
Note over FE,ADB: YRTM (Role Page Task)
FE->>GW: POST /api/v1/setting/role-page-tasks/reference-data
GW->>SET: Forward
SET->>SDB: Load modules->sections->pages + roles + tasks + privileges
SET-->>GW: reference-data
GW-->>FE: Response

FE->>GW: POST /api/v1/setting/role-page-tasks/preview
GW->>SET: Forward
SET->>IAUTH: /internal/role-page-tasks/{roleCode}/get
IAUTH->>ADB: Read role_page_task_access (company)
IAUTH-->>SET: task access list
SET-->>GW: preview
GW-->>FE: Response

FE->>GW: POST /api/v1/setting/role-page-tasks/update-by-id
GW->>SET: Forward
SET->>IAUTH: /internal/role-page-tasks/update
IAUTH->>ADB: Upsert role_page_task_access
IAUTH-->>SET: result
SET-->>GW: response
GW-->>FE: Response

FE->>GW: POST /api/v1/setting/role-page-tasks/check
GW->>SET: Forward
SET->>IAUTH: Check canAccess by role/page/task/company
IAUTH-->>SET: canAccess
SET-->>GW: response
GW-->>FE: Response
end
